  "description": "RemoteCLIP is the first vision-language foundation model for remote sensing, trained on a large-scale, unified image-caption dataset derived from diverse remote sensing sources. It enables robust visual feature learning with rich semantics and aligned text embeddings, supporting zero-shot, few-shot, and retrieval tasks.",
